{
  "label": "soccer20",
  "title_zh": "",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label soccer20:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene soccergirls0",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/soccergirls0.webp",
      "alt": "soccergirls0"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I decide to spend yet another morning at the soccer field.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I feel like I’ve been doing that a lot lately.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "\"It’s a little taxing coming all the way to[school] first thing in the morning, especially on the",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "weekend, but I’ve managed to somehow get used to it on account of that whole ‘teaching’ thing I do.\"",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Combine that with the fact that my trips here are normally pretty exhausting to begin with and it’s surprising that I’m still even showing up.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Who would have thought I’d get so hooked on hanging around a girls’ soccer team?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Sure, there are the skin tight shorts...the thigh-highs...the toned and developing muscles...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Actually, it does make sense that I keep coming here when I look at it that way.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ".........",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "......",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene soccergirls1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/soccergirls1.webp",
      "alt": "soccergirls1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "\"I spot the three girls I know the names of on a nearby...whatever this",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "thing is and come to a full stop several feet away without them noticing.\"",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "\"I wait a moment to find out if they are talking about me (They aren’t) before",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "deciding to call out and get myself involved in the conversation...\"",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "menu:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Hey, Karin",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "$ karin_love += 1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "$ hikarin = True",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey, Karin. What are you three up to today?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene soccergirls2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/soccergirls2.webp",
      "alt": "soccergirls2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ah-! W-W-What?! Who’s there?!",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Open your eyes and find out...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene soccergirls3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/soccergirls3.webp",
      "alt": "soccergirls3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh...Umm...Hey?...",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You kind of surprised me. I didn’t even hear you coming.",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Heya, Sensei. Why’d ya call out to Karin? You know she has a heart attack whenever a boy shows up.",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "s \"That’s precisely why I called out to her instead of you or Kirin. I",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "figured it would be funnier if Karin were to get all surprised and whatnot.\"",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And, of course, I was right.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene soccergirls4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/soccergirls4.webp",
      "alt": "soccergirls4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Am I...a plaything to you?! You can’t just toy with my condition like that!",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "s \"It seems a little off to call it a condition, but I’ll try to keep that in mind",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "the next time I sneak up on you.\"",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": There will be more times?!",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Of course. I’ll have you warm up to me if it’s the last thing I do.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene soccergirls5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/soccergirls5.webp",
      "alt": "soccergirls5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Um...well...",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I guess if you're okay with waiting...I-",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Aaaaaanyway...I’m gonna interrupt this special moment to bring you an important announcement.",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait, what?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Hey, Miku",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "$ miku_love += 1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "$ himiku = True",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey, Miku. What are you guys up to?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene soccergirls6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/soccergirls6.webp",
      "alt": "soccergirls6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, Sensei! We’re just hangin’ around on the giant blue step thingy, talkin’ about life and whatnot.",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why is the soccer team having a discussion about life so early in the morning?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Shouldn’t you three be practicing for whatever fake-game you have coming up next?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene soccergirls7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/soccergirls7.webp",
      "alt": "soccergirls7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Um...It sounds kinda rude when you call ‘em fake.",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, they are, aren’t they? They don’t count for anything.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We tend to use the word unofficial, Sensei...",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene soccergirls8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/soccergirls8.webp",
      "alt": "soccergirls8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, what Karin said. And besides, all games have a purpose! Even the fa- Erm, even the unofficial ones!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If we don’t keep practicin’ we’ll be S-O-L when it comes time to actually play a real team.",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just of out of curiosity, Miku, do you know what S-O-L stands for?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene soccergirls9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/soccergirls9.webp",
      "alt": "soccergirls9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Uh...",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Of course I do~ Hahaha...",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It stands for-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Hey, Kirin",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "$ kirin_love += 1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "$ hikirin = True",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey, Kirin. What’s up?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene soccergirls10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/soccergirls10.webp",
      "alt": "soccergirls10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Huh? What?",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh...Uhh, hey.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I saw you coming but I didn’t really think you were going to call out to me over those two.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, what gives? Did you and Kirin become secret friends behind our backs or somethin’?",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No. But we do have a sort of contract together now.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene soccergirls11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/soccergirls11.webp",
      "alt": "soccergirls11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeaaahhhh...I forgot about that...hahaha...",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": A contract? What kind of contract?",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you two working on some sort of...new training regimen or something?",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, that is one way to put it.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene soccergirls12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/soccergirls12.webp",
      "alt": "soccergirls12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Dude.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sorry. Couldn’t help it.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m confused. What other sort of contract is there?",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, now I’m kinda curious too.",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene soccergirls13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/soccergirls13.webp",
      "alt": "soccergirls13"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey! Uhh, let’s just leave it alone for now, okay? Hahahah~",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re actin’ kinda weird today...",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Shut up. Besides, didn’t you have something you wanted to ask him?",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Something to ask- Oh!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene soccergirls14",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/soccergirls14.webp",
      "alt": "soccergirls14"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sensei! I hereby proclaim you the new coach of the soccer team!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait, what?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What just happened?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "ka \"Miku decided that if you showed up today, she was just",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "going to make you the coach instead of waiting for you to agree to it.\"",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Can she do that?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene soccergirls15",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/soccergirls15.webp",
      "alt": "soccergirls15"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": There is no limit to my power! Mwahahahaha!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": She technically can’t, but are you really gonna say no to that face, Sensei?",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What face? The one she has on now?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Tremble before me, mortal!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Kirin, are you sure this is the face you’re talking about?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What’s wrong? I think she’s cute when she turns into a supervillain.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene soccergirls16",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/soccergirls16.webp",
      "alt": "soccergirls16"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Jokin’ aside, I’m puttin’ my foot down, Sensei. You’ve kept me waitin’ for far too long.",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We’ve all got achin’ muscles just beggin’ to be massaged by those magic hands of yours!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene soccergirls17",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/soccergirls17.webp",
      "alt": "soccergirls17"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait, what?!",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene soccergirls18",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/soccergirls18.webp",
      "alt": "soccergirls18"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah! Haven’t you heard? Sensei is apparently a super good moose!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Masseuse, Miku. It’s masseuse.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Also, I’m just okay. I never said I was a god.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait, Miku! I know you said it would be good to have him around, but I’m pretty sure he’s not allowed to like, touch us...",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t mind~ My legs have been suuuuuper sore lately. I’m sure some physical therapy will get all of those knots out in a jiff.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why wouldn’t Sensei be allowed to touch us? The last coach did it all the time and you always talked about how great ya felt after.",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene soccergirls19",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/soccergirls19.webp",
      "alt": "soccergirls19"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The last coach was a girl, though...She didn’t have any...ulterior motives...",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I can hear you, you know...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hmm...",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene soccergirls20",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/soccergirls20.webp",
      "alt": "soccergirls20"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Miku pauses for a moment and stares deep into my soul.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "She doesn’t believe the whole ‘ulterior motives’ thing, does she?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Wait a second. I do have ulterior motives. Why am I getting so up in arms about this accusation?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": *Ahem* Sensei. Or shall I say...Coach!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sensei is fine.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Coach! Do you have any ulterior motives when it comes to the [young]women of the soccer team?",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene soccergirls21",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/soccergirls21.webp",
      "alt": "soccergirls21"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, Sensei~ You weren’t planning on doing anything naughty to us, were you?",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Kirin, I’m really going to need you to keep it together right now...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Of course not. I won’t touch anyone how they don’t want to be touched.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene soccergirls22",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/soccergirls22.webp",
      "alt": "soccergirls22"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hold on a second...I’m not entirely satisfied with that answer.",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What do you mean by how they want to be-",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sounds good to me! You’re the moose here. You know what’ll work best.",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene soccergirls23",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/soccergirls23.webp",
      "alt": "soccergirls23"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Miku! Don’t I get any sort of say in this? I’m second in command and a year older than you.",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene soccergirls24",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/soccergirls24.webp",
      "alt": "soccergirls24"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You're also a year older than me and I’m still like three times more mature than you~",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene soccergirls25",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/soccergirls25.webp",
      "alt": "soccergirls25"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You still sleep with a teddy bear, Kirin! I don’t want to hear it!",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And if you’re more mature than me, how come your curfew is an hour earlier than mine?",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene soccergirls26",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/soccergirls26.webp",
      "alt": "soccergirls26"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Who cares about a stupid curfew? At least I don’t start crying any time a boy looks at me.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So, Sensei-Coach-Master-",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Master has been added on now as well?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": As you can see, things can get a little dysfunctional around these here parts.",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So what that means is, as our new coach, you’re gonna have to keep these two in check so they stop frickin’ fightin’ all the time.",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are they really always like this?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well...not all the time. But yeah, pretty often.",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I try to step in when I can but it’s not like a pipsqueak who’s just barely outgrown her trainin' bra can really do much to someone Karin’s size.",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And Kirin’s kinda scary in her own way too. Like one of those feisty types that’ll pull ‘yer hair if ya mess with her.",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Yeah, I definitely get that vibe from Kirin as well.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And you’re really sure about me being the coach? I think I’ve told you before, but I really can’t be here every day.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene soccergirls27",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/soccergirls27.webp",
      "alt": "soccergirls27"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s totally fine! We can always do stuff later on if ya can’t make it to the field.",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene soccergirls26",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/soccergirls26.webp",
      "alt": "soccergirls26"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
