      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "mi \"So if ya ever want to just do laps around the park or somethin’ like that, you can always let",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "your good pal Miku know.\"",
      "zh": ""
    },
